      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like you're being an ai and telling me what you're supposed to say. i'm not looking for a lecture or some hotline number. i'm just asking if there's a philosophical point to it. like, if life is just a loop of suffering, isn't it kind of logical to just stop? isn't there a way to look at it that isn't just \"keep fighting\"?",
